ed acceptance checks from optional testing, and specify whether cross-internet multiplayer must be verified without a second physical device.\\\"],\n  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"H.E.R.O. Another Day\\\",\n    \\\"tagline\\\": \\\"Three miners. One jetpack. Still your shift.\\\",\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Descend a living mine, blast blocked passages and tether three stranded miners back to the last lift. Dodge cave creatures, flooded workings and lava in a cel-shaded rescue adventure, solo or with a crew.\\\",\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Action\\\",\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"H.E.R.O. (1984)\\\",\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"\\\",\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–4\\\",\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"Move: left stick / A,D; fly: Cross / Space or W; aim: right stick / mouse; pulse: R2 / left click; charge: Square / E; rescue: Triangle / F; pause: Options / Esc. Touch: left thumb moves and flies, right thumb aims and fires.\\\",\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\\"3d\\\", \\\"arcade\\\", \\\"co-op\\\", \\\"side-scrolling\\\", \\\"retro\\\", \\\"exploration\\\"]\n  }\n}\nJSON\npython3 HERO-Another-Day-HERO-1984-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-191348/build.py\nnode --check HERO-Another-Day-HERO-1984-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-191348/world.js\nnode --check HERO-Another-Day-HERO-1984-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-191348/game.js\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
